'' A generic's T inferred from a literal follows the one literal model (lexer/littype.bas) that
'' Check, constfold and #if use: an unsuffixed 3000000000 is UINTEGER (inference said INTEGER), a
'' suffix decides first. Expected output is fbc-modern's.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: -target windows-x86_64 tests/codegen/src/literal-model-infer.bas -o tests/codegen/literalmodelinfer.exe
'' ENV: TKO_LIBPATH=toolchains/tiko-windows/lib/windows-x86_64
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 0
'' RUN: tests/codegen/literalmodelinfer.exe
'' EXPECT-RUN-EXIT: 0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 8:3000000000
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 8:0
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 8:4294967295
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 4:-2147483648
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 4:1.5
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 8:18446744073709551615
'' EXPECT-RUN-OUT: 8:4294967296
